('CIT_ISL_JIBRIL_QUR','ENT_ISL_JIBRIL','SRC_QURAN','The Qur’an','Surah 2:97','Say (O Muhammad, to mankind): Who is an enemy to Gabriel! For he it is who hath revealed (this Scripture) to thy heart by Allah''s leave, confirming that which was (revealed) before it, and a guidance and glad tidings to believers;','Marmaduke Pickthall',1930,'https://tanzil.net/#2:97','https://quran.com/2/97','primary-verbatim','English (Pickthall); sura:ayah is translation-independent — consult the Arabic (linked).',true,'Verse located by name (no ayah in attestation); confirm it is the intended reference.',DATE '2026-06-18','deterministic sura:ayah lookup, or name-anchored where no ayah given (Pickthall, Tanzil)',1),
